{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zx1XU4XiFg1792726461.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>21年前執勤時遇襲癱瘓、上月離世的警員朱振國，以警隊最高榮譽舉殯。</p><p></p><p>儀式在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行，靈堂掛上「浩氣長存」橫幅。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL-1000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uYyT4OclFG1792725336.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超到場致意，警務處處長周一鳴門外迎接，一同步入靈堂。出席的還包括政務司副司長卓永興。</p><p></p><p>2005年朱振國執勤期間被一名青年拔刀割傷頸部，因大量失血令腦部缺氧致全身癱瘓，上月中因器官衰竭在廣華醫院離世，終年52歲。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL-1000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026syVXvNigAd1792726464.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>辭靈禮後靈柩蓋上區旗，移送上由警車改裝的靈車，在場警員列隊致敬作最後道別。靈柩會先移送到長沙灣警署舉行道別儀式，然後安葬浩園。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:07.335824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.865471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:21.211922+00:00","content_hash":"2a1c6782e7f62c9d96d629623e7f0986ca0d744276b5bb2712a02c5f1b6f8cad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:07.335824+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}